      "username": "Christopher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-12T22:17:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Because the reveal wordings say \"Reveal cards from the <span class=\"bbcode-b\">villain deck</span> . . . \" not \"Reveal cards from the villain deck and the villain trash . . . \"</p>\n<p>We’re just telling you to look through the deck.  It’s different from the search, because you don’t pick whichever one you want - you get the first one you come to.  And if you don’t find any in all your revealings?  Then nothing happens.</p>",
