      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Well, if you shuffle the trash into the deck, then you're not revealing cards from the trash, you're still revealing them from the deck.\n\nSo it sounds like you're not moved by the argument that revealing a card is essentially the same thing as drawing a card, and if you're told to draw a card when the deck is empty, then you automatically shuffle the trash to make a new deck so you can complete the draw.",
