      "created_at": "2012-04-21T21:26:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ehm… I think I’ve been killing myself, so question on “Reveal.”  Let’s use Operative as the example since I just failed against her.  Her ability says “Reveal cards until an underboss is revealed, then put it into play” or something like that.  I’ve been revealing, and playing, any One Shots that come out that way thinking it was meant to be different than something like “Search the villain deck for the first underboss and put it into play.”  So… I’m guessing the One Shots/etc. revealed by her ability don’t actually get played and instead just go into the trash?</p>",
